{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Blood Bond pays the Bloodmage when the bonded ally is hit (#1930)",
  "contract": [
    "Blood Bond 504627 applies its aura to the ally. Its original trigger 505325 restores 10 internal Rage",
    "and base health to the Bloodmage who cast the bond. The spell_proc row selects direct damage; the",
    "AuraScript redirects the reward to the bond caster. This fixture uses a defensive Scholomance Dark",
    "Summoner 11582 and ordinary attacks, with the Bloodmage twenty yards from the ally. A control requires",
    "real ally damage before the bond and no reward. After a normal bond cast, actual 505325 energize events",
    "must reach the caster and never the ally. Raw Rage alone is insufficient evidence because damage taken",
    "can generate Rage independently. Native threat redirection and client presentation remain outside this",
    "scenario.",
    "The original periodic speed helper 505169 accepts only peaceful targets. Combat skips that tick so its",
    "rejection cannot expire the thirty-minute parent bond."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "bloodmage",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 20,
      "level": 80,
